G65|score-memories-bottleneck|~~closed=2026-03-13b~~
  was=score_memories() called qwen2.5:7b on every turn; p50=76s preparse; worst=742s
  fix=removed both branches in main.py; cortex.search() Phase2 embedding rerank is better
  result=preparse_search p50 ~500ms

G66|habit-trigger-format|~~closed=2026-03-13c~~
  was=_score_habit() treated multi-word trigger as single substring; zero habits fired
  fix=three-format dispatch: pipe-separated|legacy-space(min5-token)|single-token
  result=PROC_GREETING fires; all legacy habits now match correctly

G67|db-proxy-no-commit|~~closed=2026-03-13c~~
  was=_DBContext.__exit__() closed connection without commit(); every write silently rolled back
  fix=added commit() before close() when exc_type is None; rollback() on exception
  result=cortex.store() now persists; book_learner nodes verified in DB

G68|habit-response-fallback|~~closed=2026-03-13c~~
  was=habits with no 'action' key showed "Habit executed. [PROC_xxx: narrative...]" to user
  fix=added actions[] list support (random choice); PROC_GREETING updated with igorish responses
  result=greetings show human-facing text; any habit can have response variety

G69|temporal-anchoring|~~closed=2026-03-13c~~
  was=memories injected into LLM context with no creation date; Igor treated old memories as current
  fix=_build_memory_context() shows "stored X days ago"; _build_ring_context() shows YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM for non-today entries
  result=Igor can now distinguish past from present in his own context

